   <title><![CDATA[The Relationship Between Faith and Christians playing “Politics” in the U.S. Supreme Court [God, Law, and Liberty]]]></title>
   <link/>
   <description><![CDATA[<p>When Christians lose the metaphysic and cosmology of Colossians 1:15-20, we fall prey to the &ldquo;empty traditions and philosophies of men.&rdquo; David uses John Owen&rsquo;s exposition of Hebrews 11:1, legislative testimony from the most prominent pro-life lawyer in America, and what the founder of a Christian law school said he teaches his students to show how a wrong metaphysic and cosmology turns making the argument of law into counting votes on the U.S. Supreme Court.</p>]]></description>
   <author><![CDATA[David Fowler]]></author>
